#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is waiting for a quick check before it can do this. To skip the wait, verify an email address in Settings > Security."
msgstr "บัญชีของคุณกําลังรอเช็คด่วน ก่อนที่มันจะทําได้ เพื่อข้ามการรอ ให้ตรวจสอบที่อยู่อีเมลในการตั้งค่า > รปภ."

msgid ""
"Your account is waiting for a quick check before you can post, comment, vote or follow. You can look around and set up your profile in the meantime.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"To skip the wait, add and verify an email address in [Settings > Security](/settings/security)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your account is your own now. It no longer has the child lock and your parent or guardian can no longer see it. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account needs to be at least 30 days old to post automatically."
msgstr "บัญชีของคุณต้องมีอย่างน้อย 30 วันที่จะโพสต์โดยอัตโนมัติ."

#, machine, plain1
